 and 900/1150 K); tel.boost.mismatch 32 (not baked) and 64 (a governed
 diesel's compressor failing rule (c)'s rated check at 0.96); local, step A of
 turbine-match-design.md, not pushed (the lead: lands with the bake)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LFAGgSxnqsW2XUcFC39ruQ
---
 sim/boost/boost.fm    |  7 +++++
